rows.en:
He built a screen around an empty bed in the lodging facility and let her use it.
During the day he had her go somewhere else on the school grounds, and at night, once everyone was asleep, he let her back into the lodging facility.
She told him this.{p}

"You broke your promise..."
The Upside-Down Woman appeared behind Sodeyama.
And from behind, she...{p}

"Stop... gwaaah...!☆"
The Upside-Down Woman hacked Sodeyama's body apart, piece after piece.
His blood splashed all over my face, and I couldn't really tell what was happening.{p}

"Good, good, that's a good boy.
Just like you promised, don't you tell anyone..."
With that, the Upside-Down Woman slid away, vanishing as if climbing upward.{p}

If you sleep in the bed where Ono died, just his head floats up in front of you, glowing faintly.
And the eyes in that face dart around like a bug's, and the skin glitters like a bug's, too.
Just like a bug, it's the most brilliant color you've ever seen...{p}

I see.......
I pray that curiosity of yours doesn't bring you misfortune down the road.
Then, instead of a bug story, shall I tell you an even more disgusting one?{p}
